    "serviceDescription": "The Okta IDaaS Regulated Cloud service offering provides centralized identity and access management capabilities to customers who want to manage access across any application or device, whether they are on-premise in the customer's office/data center or in the cloud. The Okta IDaaS Regulated Cloud service provides several important capabilities, including:\n- Okta Identity Engine (OIE)\n- Okta Multi-factor authentication (MFA)\n- Okta Adaptive MFA (AMFA)\n- Okta Single Sign-On (SSO)\n- Okta Verify\n- Okta API Integration\n- Okta FastPass - NIST 800-63B AAL2/AAL3 authenticator",
